---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Proposal Two: Feasible Democratic Reform Without a Full Rewrite"
  description="Practical democratic reform package without a complete constitutional rewrite."
>
  <h1>Proposal Two: Feasible Democratic Reform Without a Full Rewrite</h1>
  <p>This version focuses on reforms that could be pursued without a complete constitutional rewrite.</p>
  <p>Possible routes include federal statute, state law, congressional rules, agency enforcement, interstate compact, and targeted constitutional amendment.</p>

  <div class="btn-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/assets/pdfs/feasible-democratic-reform-proposal.pdf" download>
      Download Proposal Two (PDF)
    </a>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <iframe class="pdf-viewer" title="Proposal Two PDF" src="/assets/pdfs/feasible-democratic-reform-proposal.pdf"></iframe>
    <p>If your browser cannot display the PDF, use the download button above or <a href="/assets/pdfs/feasible-democratic-reform-proposal.pdf" download>download it directly here</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Why this proposal matters</h2>
      <p>It offers concrete reforms that can be debated and pursued through existing legal channels.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>What makes this version more practical</h2>
      <p>It deliberately targets feasible paths that can move through institutions without waiting for a full constitutional rewrite.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>How to comment</h2>
      <p>Use GitHub Discussions once configured, or send critique by email to contact@citizenstewardship.org.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section placeholder">
    <h3>Giscus Comments Placeholder (Proposal Two)</h3>
    <p>Comments are not active yet. Replace this placeholder with the generated Giscus script after Discussions is configured.</p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
